OL,3,GNEWSA'Fascinating' rare beetle found in
OL,4,AWales again after 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnne Hobbs, from the Bumblebee
OL,7,FConservation Trust, said it was "very
OL,8,Fexciting" that the evidence suggested
OL,9,Fthe species was breeding in Wales
OL,10,Fagain.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
